    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The river which forms the eastern boundary of our farm has always played an important part in our lives.",
      "translation": "形成我们农场东部边界的那条河，一直在我们的生活中扮演着重要的角色。",
      "startTime": 13.91,
      "endTime": 21.25,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "boundary",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "边界"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Without it we could not make a living. There is only enough spring water to supply the needs of the house so we have to pump from the river for farm use.",
      "translation": "没有它我们就无法谋生。泉水仅够供应屋内的需要，所以我们必须从河里抽水供农场使用。",
      "startTime": 21.26,
      "endTime": 32.58,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "pump",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "抽水"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We tell the river all our secrets. We know instinctively, just as beekeepers with their bees, that misfortune might overtake us if the important events of our lives were not related to it.",
      "translation": "我们把所有的秘密都告诉这条河。我们本能地知道，就像养蜂人对着他们的蜜蜂一样，如果我们生活中的大事不告诉它，不幸可能会降临到我们身上。",
      "startTime": 32.59,
      "endTime": 48.61,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "instinctively",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "本能地"
          },
          {
            "word": "misfortune",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "不幸"
          },
          {
            "word": "overtake",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "（灾难等）降临，赶上"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We have special river birthday parties in the summer. Sometimes we go upstream to a favourite backwater, sometimes we have our party at the boathouse, which a predecessor of ours at the farm built in the meadow hard by the deepest pool for swimming and diving.",
      "translation": "夏天我们有特别的河边生日会。有时我们逆流而上到一处喜欢的停滞水域，有时我们在船屋里聚会。那座船屋是我们农场的一个前任房主盖在草场上的，紧挨着最深的深潭，可以用来游泳和跳水。",
      "startTime": 48.62,
      "endTime": 67.73,
      "analysis": {
