    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We welcome the seasons by the riverside, crowning the youngest girl with flowers in the spring, holding a summer festival on Midsummer Eve, giving thanks for the harvest in the autumn, and throwing a holly wreath into the current in the winter.",
      "translation": "我们在河边迎接四季，春天给最年轻的女孩戴上花冠，仲夏夜举行夏季祭典，秋天感谢收获，冬天把冬青花环抛入河流中。",
      "startTime": 74.5,
      "endTime": 92.65,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
