    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "After a long period of rain the river may overflow its banks. This is a rare occurrence as our climate seldom goes to extremes.",
      "translation": "经过长时间的下雨，河水可能会漫过河岸。这种情况很少发生，因为我们的气候很少走极端。",
      "startTime": 92.66,
      "endTime": 103.1,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "overflow",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "溢出"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We are lucky in that only the lower fields, which make up a very small proportion of our farm, are affected by flooding, but other farms are less favourably sited, and flooding can sometimes spell disaster for their owners.",
      "translation": "我们很幸运，只有占农场比例很小的一小块低地会受到洪水的影响，但其他农场的选址就没有那么有利了，洪水有时会给农场主带来灾难。",
      "startTime": 103.11,
      "endTime": 120.32,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "proportion",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "比例"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
