    {
      "id": "s21",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "As the floods had put the telephone out of order, we could not find out how they were managing. From an attic window we could get a sweeping view of the river where their land joined ours, and at the most critical juncture we took turns in watching that point.",
      "translation": "由于洪水使电话失灵，我们无法了解他们的情况。从阁楼窗户可以看到他们的土地与我们接壤处的河流全景。在最关键的时刻，我们轮流看守那一带。",
      "startTime": 140.08,
      "endTime": 157.79,
      "analysis": {
